    "detailed_description": "Are you bored of doing the same thing? Take a break and try this racing game of Car Parkour!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe given game is a perfect example of human imagination. We propose to raise your adrenaline level more than usual with the help of a sports car that is predestined for parkour elements. Your mission is to choose a car to your liking and start on a path full of risk and unforeseen moments. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nBe careful not to fall and to reach the final destination of each level. The belt will not save you here, so pay maximum attention to the movements you make.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features :<br />\r\n- 8 supercars<br />\r\n- Realistic car control<br />\r\n- Saving checkpoints",
